    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d657e5e94e0a44c82d4662",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被她察觉到了。恢复需要时间，\n可是距离比赛又太近了。所以我本想告诉她\n还有放弃这个选项的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f966181b4a7e49246c9911d43452328da0b606a16f2a812da89aaeaba74597",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
