    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d636bd0d6d9d8910dcee07ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你不会夺走它的吧？\n你也应该早就明白了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4326b85b20d0eaa19e35e8da632976d58df07f35babbaecbb17b5a56511400e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ba4651ab2157520da5e0f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目的眼中闪烁着光芒……\n那里映出的对胜利的执着，是如此强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744feea773a6c417dc1aafcfd001d57cedcbf550ec045b1c042ba2612f0fb372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b9d6d8f0537cba8ca0ab94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我久违地感到脊背发凉……\n但、不仅如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf533fb12433d7adc693d38f6c5d6edc771ee4b977fa8d4c1e49c9795584e484",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2401a4c186d91937ab85b0ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利的喜悦就是如此的……美妙啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6a6c9a05a915d7070269fbe7f33c78fc2ddc679e1144a22a8212bc834c41fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
