    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf3ca1db046ad442f77554be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是吧，训练员……！\n我能做到的，因为――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c92d5c99322dfc38b84f9d30e7a816bf83eb65017f82d9ef63034048098093f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6842590bf37e1b3ff1d5d5b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没事的，我们两个什么都能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c4e4fd18c44ee8264e89774fb8e246731717e8b18ab2fd0376e31a527ec31d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff96ba56d835919d4868ed0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该选择的道理已经决定，全力支持的觉悟也有了。\n那么现在为了不让她想太多――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab5b4f0ca6f730006c05be15211ec99bdfc047f649518627ba43bf4b1c60412",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
