    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8f0e4fa02d0daf2a946838",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，在和保健室的老师也好好商量过后，\n敲定了直到『安田纪念』为止的训练计划。\n――我要全力支持她，平安抵达那一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f283421f9ab522c32e8d7cef73b365bfddfac2aead11cf51eac774ab0100501",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:654ead47cf5992f87e28405b",
      "kind": "story",
